@ko_media_smear
# prose-audit: Grade B — Low KO relations now trigger a hostile media cycle where every response carries a political cost and pushes the field rightward.
title: "PiS's useful ally": the KO media smear cycle
subtitle: Low trust with KO lets allied outlets frame Lewica as a spoiler helping the right
face-image: img/poland/events/tvp-headquarters.webp
new-page: true
